cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PANINI-DR, please cite the paper below."
title: "PANINI-DR"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/roychowdhuryresearch/panini-dr"
url: "https://roychowdhuryresearch.github.io/PANINI-DR_Project_Page/"
abstract: >-
  PANINI-DR is a multi-agent deep-research harness that keeps an explicit research
  workspace of subquestions, dependencies, findings and evidence, and verifies each
  finding before it is reused.
keywords:
  - deep research
  - LLM agents
  - multi-agent
  - verification
  - Generative Semantic Workspace
  - BrowseComp-Plus
  - FRAMES
  - MoNaCo
